## 2. Конфігурація

```ruby
# config/initializers/web_push.rb
module VapidConfig
  module_function

  def public_key
    Rails.application.credentials.dig(:vapid, :public_key) || ENV.fetch("VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY")
  end

  def private_key
    Rails.application.credentials.dig(:vapid, :private_key) || ENV.fetch("VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY")
  end

  # Має бути mailto: або https:// URL
  def subject
    Rails.application.credentials.dig(:vapid, :subject) ||
      ENV.fetch("VAPID_SUBJECT", "mailto:admin@example.com")
  end

  def to_h
    { subject: subject, public_key: public_key, private_key: private_key }
  end
end
